# TLS material — generated locally, never committed
# ----------------------
# compose.postgres.yaml bind-mounts server.crt / server.key / ca.crt and the
# whole directory into the TLS bridge. A real private key dropped here would
# otherwise be committable. Keep the directory itself via .gitkeep so a fresh
# clone has the mount point; see certs/README.md for how to populate it.
certs/*
!certs/.gitkeep
!certs/README.md
